{"name": "Last Bullet", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"366\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683190/extras/97b27cba123e7bb6985633d0e6368d57.poster.avif?t=1786079863\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683190/extras/97b27cba123e7bb6985633d0e6368d57.webm?t=1786079863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683190/extras/97b27cba123e7bb6985633d0e6368d57.mp4?t=1786079863\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Last Bullet is a barrel bullet builder where you shoot through relentless waves of enemies. As you kill enemies, you will earn new bullets and slot them together to create a powerful gun capable of devastating chain attacks.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build a Powerful Gun:</strong> Earn unique bullets and slot them into your barrel to create massive combos and chain attacks. The Gun fires in a sequence to create massive chain reactions!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"366\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683190/extras/c344a95f6699b1ac805d5b83fb1f7174.poster.avif?t=1786079863\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4683190/extras/c344a95f6699b1ac805d5b83fb1f7174.webm?t=1786079863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"